          "note": "1. Alkyl halides (CₙH₂ₙ₊₁X) (–C–X): a main subheading of 19.4 Nomenclature of Aliphatic Organic Compounds, its own page (owner 2026-11-04); PDF 41-41."
        }
      ],
      "body": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "IUPAC naam halogenoalkane hai (zyada theek: monohaloalkane, yani aik halogen wala alkane)."
          },
          {
            "type": "equation",
            "latex": "\\underset{\\text{chloromethane}}{\\ce{CH3-Cl}} \\qquad \\underset{\\text{2-bromopropane}}{\\ce{CH3-CH(Br)-CH3}} \\qquad \\underset{\\text{1-iodo-3-methylbutane}}{\\ce{CH3-CH(CH3)-CH2-CH2-I}}",
            "text_alt": "CH₃–Cl (chloromethane);  CH₃–CH(Br)–CH₃ (2-bromopropane);  CH₃–CH(CH₃)–CH₂–CH₂–I (1-iodo-3-methylbutane)"
          },
          {
            "type": "callout",
            "tone": "correction",
            "title": "Kitab ki ghalti",
            "text": "Kitab teesri misal ka naam “3-methyl-1-iodobutane” likhti hai. Prefixes alphabetical order (alphabet ki tarteeb) mein likhe jate hain: “iodo” pehle, “methyl” baad mein. Sahi naam 1-iodo-3-methylbutane hai."
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
